# Media assets
# Keep the Safari-compatible MP4 files in the repository; original camera
# files remain ignored because they are larger and use less compatible codecs.
public/images/*/*
# Re-include media directories so the specific file rules below can apply.
!public/images/
!public/images/*/
!public/images/*/*.mp4
!public/images/*/*.MP4
# Subtitles are small text files needed for CORS-safe <track>.
!public/images/*/*.vtt

